萬家。」蠋固謝。燕人曰：「子不聽，吾引三軍而屠畫邑。」王蠋曰：「忠臣不事二君，貞女不更二夫。齊王不聽吾諫，故退而耕於野。國既破亡，吾不能存；今又劫之以兵為君將，是助桀為暴也。與其生而無義，固不如烹！」遂經其頸於樹枝，自奮絕脰而死。齊亡大夫聞之，曰：「王蠋，布衣也，義不北面於燕，況在位食祿者乎！」乃相聚如莒，求諸子，立為襄王。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-082-tiandan:m009-0010","start":10,"end":12,"surface":"王蠋","kind":"person","person_id":"rqv_zm4_apj","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-082-tiandan:m009-0030","start":30,"end":32,"surface":"王蠋","kind":"person","person_id":"rqv_zm4_apj","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-082-tiandan:m009-0040","start":40,"end":41,"surface":"蠋","kind":"person","person_id":"rqv_zm4_apj","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-082-tiandan:m009-0048","start":48,"end":49,"surface":"子","kind":"person","person_id":"rqv_zm4_apj","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-082-tiandan:m009-0054","start":54,"end":55,"surface":"子","kind":"person","person_id":"rqv_zm4_apj","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-082-tiandan:m009-0059","start":59,"end":60,"surface":"子","kind":"person","person_id":"rqv_zm4_apj","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-082-tiandan:m009-0064","start":64,"end":65,"surface":"蠋","kind":"person","person_id":"rqv_zm4_apj","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-082-tiandan:m009-0068","start":68,"end":70,"surface":"燕人","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、未定角色或泛論保存；神為策略敘事，不補具名神祇或宗族親屬。"},{"id":"c-shiji-082-tiandan:m009-0073","start":73,"end":74,"surface":"子","kind":"person","person_id":"rqv_zm4_apj","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-082-tiandan:m009-0087","start":87,"end":89,"surface":"王蠋","kind":"person","person_id":"rqv_zm4_apj","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-082-tiandan:m009-0092","start":92,"end":94,"surface":"忠臣","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、未定角色或泛論保存；神為策略敘事，不補具名神祇或宗族親屬。"},{"id":"c-shiji-082-tiandan:m009-0096","start":96,